Package: supply-gate
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Supply Gate Maintainers <supply-gate@tempest.com.br>
Depends: coreutils, findutils, gawk | mawk, sed, grep
Description: Shim-based supply-chain policy enforcement and AI Jail routing
 Intercepts npm, pnpm, yarn, bun, pip, pip3, uv, poetry, cargo, go and AI
 coding CLIs (claude, gemini, codex, agy) via PATH-precedence shims,
 enforcing dependency cooldown/registry policy (soft or hard mode) and
 routing AI tool invocations through an ai-jail sandbox when one is
 configured. See /usr/share/supply-gate/GUIDE.md after install.
